		    Source = Sql.Database("eal-sql01.database.windows.net", "Recordbase_EmergeAotearoa_Elite", [Query="#(lf)if object_id ('tempdb..#test') is not null drop table #test#(lf)if object_id ('tempdb..#testy2') is not null drop table #testy2#(lf)if object_id ('tempdb..#referralbystatus2') is not null drop table #referralbystatus2#(lf)if object_id ('tempdb..#accepts2') is not null drop table #accepts2#(lf)if object_id ('tempdb..#createdpivot') is not null drop table #createdpivot #(lf)if object_id ('tempdb..#lastdata') is not null drop table #lastdata #(lf)if object_id ('tempdb..#lastdata2') is not null drop table #lastdata2#(lf)#(lf)SELECT factreferralstatus.ReferralID#(lf), referralstatusstartdate#(lf), referralstatustypecode#(lf), referralstatustypegroup#(lf), referralstatustypestatusorder#(lf), factreferral.personid#(lf), factreferral.ReferralReceivedDate#(lf), dimTeam.TeamID#(lf), dimTeam.teamname #(lf), dimperson.personfirstname#(lf), dimperson.personlastname #(lf),ReferralStatusTypeReasonDescription#(lf)#(lf)into #test#(lf) #(lf) FROM [dl].[FactReferralStatus]#(lf)#(lf)  inner join dl.DimReferralStatusType on FactReferralStatus.ReferralStatusTypeID = DimReferralStatusType.ReferralStatusTypeID#(lf)  inner join dl.factreferral on FactReferralStatus.referralid = factreferral.referralid#(lf)  inner join dl.DimPerson on factreferral.PersonID = dimperson.personid#(lf)  inner join dl.dimteam on factreferral.teamid = dimteam.teamid#(lf)  inner join dl.DimTeamFunction on dimteam.TeamFunctionID = dimteamfunction.TeamFunctionID#(lf)--  inner join dl.dimethnicity on dimperson.ethnicity1id = dimethnicity.EthnicityID#(lf)  left join dl.DimReferralStatusTypeReason on FactReferralStatus.ReferralStatusTypeReasonID = DimReferralStatusTypeReason.ReferralStatusTypeReasonID#(lf)#(lf)  where #(lf)  teamname like '%ease%up%'#(lf)  and ReferralStatusStartDate >'2019-06-30'#(lf)  #(lf)#(lf)  order by ReferralStatusStartDate#(lf)#(lf)#(lf)#(lf)  select * #(lf)  into #referralbystatus2#(lf)  from #test#(lf)   select #(lf)  row_number () over (partition by personid order by personid, referralstatustypegroup, referralstatusstartdate desc) as referralno,#(lf)   *#(lf)  into #accepts2#(lf)  from #referralbystatus2#(lf)  where referralstatustypecode = 'accepted'#(lf)#(lf)   #(lf)  select#(lf)  personid,#(lf)  [1],#(lf)[2],#(lf)[3],#(lf)[4],#(lf)[5],#(lf)#(lf)datediff(month,[2],[1]) as diff2and1,#(lf)datediff(month,[3],[2]) as diff3and2,#(lf)datediff(month,[4],[3]) as diff4and3,#(lf)datediff(month,[5],[4]) as diff5and4#(lf)#(lf)into #createdpivot#(lf)#(lf)from#(lf)(#(lf)#(lf)  select personid , referralno, referralstatusstartdate#(lf)from #accepts2 #(lf)) as data1#(lf)pivot(max(referralstatusstartdate) for #(lf)referralno in #(lf)(#(lf)[1],#(lf)[2],#(lf)[3],#(lf)[4],#(lf)[5]#(lf))#(lf))as pvt #(lf)#(lf)order by personid #(lf)#(lf)#(lf)--===only has 1 referral - all good, take this referral#(lf)select personid , [1] as createddate #(lf)into #testy2#(lf)from #createdpivot #(lf)where [2] is null #(lf)#(lf)union all#(lf)#(lf)--===where there is a second referral only#(lf)select personid, [1] from #createdpivot #(lf)where [2] is not null and diff2and1 >3 and [3] is null#(lf)union all#(lf)select personid, [2] from #createdpivot #(lf)where [2] is not null and diff2and1 >3 and [3] is null#(lf)--so first referral is over 3 months of second referral so both are ok so take both#(lf)#(lf)--=====first is within 3 months of second referral - take second referral only#(lf)#(lf)union all#(lf)select personid, [2] from #createdpivot #(lf)where [2] is not null and diff2and1 <=3 and [3] is null#(lf)#(lf)#(lf)#(lf)--===================================#(lf)#(lf)--===where there is a 3rd referral#(lf)-- if all referrals are more than 3 months then keep all 3 referrals#(lf)union all#(lf)select personid, [3] from #createdpivot#(lf)where [3] is not null and [4] is null and diff3and2 >3 and diff2and1 >3 #(lf)union all#(lf)select personid, [2] from #createdpivot#(lf)where [3] is not null and [4] is null and diff3and2 >3 and diff2and1 >3#(lf)union all#(lf)select personid, [1] from #createdpivot#(lf)where [3] is not null and [4] is null and diff3and2 >3 and diff2and1 >3 #(lf)#(lf)--======#(lf)union all#(lf)select personid, [3] from #createdpivot#(lf)where [3] is not null and [4] is null and diff3and2 >3 and diff2and1 <=3 #(lf)union all#(lf)select personid, [2] from #createdpivot#(lf)where [3] is not null and [4] is null and diff3and2 >3 and diff2and1 <=3#(lf)#(lf)union all#(lf)select personid, [3] from #createdpivot#(lf)where [3] is not null and [4] is null and diff3and2 <=3 and diff2and1 <=3 #(lf)#(lf)--=================================#(lf)--and where there's a 4th referral.... #(lf)union all#(lf)select personid, [4] from #createdpivot#(lf)where [4] is not null and [5] is  null and diff4and3 >3 and diff3and2 >3 and diff2and1 >3 #(lf)union all#(lf)select personid, [3] from #createdpivot#(lf)where [4] is not null and [5] is null and diff4and3 >3 and diff3and2 >3 and diff2and1 >3#(lf)union all#(lf)select personid, [2] from #createdpivot#(lf)where [4] is not null and [5] is null and diff4and3 >3 and diff3and2 >3 and diff2and1 >3 #(lf)union all#(lf)select personid, [1] from #createdpivot#(lf)where [4] is not null and [5] is null and diff4and3 >3 and diff3and2 >3 and diff2and1 >3#(lf)--=========================#(lf)#(lf)union all#(lf)select personid, [4] from #createdpivot#(lf)where [4] is not null and [5] is null  and diff4and3 >3 and diff3and2 >3 and diff2and1<=3#(lf)union all#(lf)select personid, [3] from #createdpivot#(lf)where [4] is not null and [5] is null  and diff4and3 >3 and diff3and2 >3 and diff2and1<=3#(lf)union all#(lf)select personid, [2] from #createdpivot#(lf)where [4] is not null and [5] is null  and diff4and3 >3 and diff3and2 >3 and diff2and1<=3#(lf)#(lf)--======#(lf)#(lf)union all#(lf)select personid, [4] from #createdpivot#(lf)where [4] is not null and [5] is null  and diff4and3 >3 and diff3and2 <=3 and diff2and1<=3#(lf)union all#(lf)select personid, [3] from #createdpivot#(lf)where [4] is not null and [5] is null  and diff4and3 >3 and diff3and2 <=3 and diff2and1<=3#(lf)#(lf)--======#(lf)union all#(lf)select personid, [4] from #createdpivot#(lf)where [4] is not null and [5] is null  and diff4and3 <=3 and diff3and2 <=3 and diff2and1<=3#(lf)#(lf)---====and god forbid, someone has 5 referrals #(lf)#(lf)union all#(lf)select personid, [5] from #createdpivot#(lf)where [4] is not null and [5] is  not null and diff5and4 >3 and diff4and3 >3 and diff3and2 >3 and diff2and1 >3 #(lf)union all#(lf)select personid, [4] from #createdpivot#(lf)where [4] is not null and [5] is not null and diff5and4 >3 and diff4and3 >3  and diff3and2 >3 and diff2and1 >3#(lf)union all#(lf)select personid, [3] from #createdpivot#(lf)where [4] is not null and [5] is not null and diff5and4 >3 and diff4and3 >3  and diff3and2 >3 and diff2and1 >3 #(lf)union all#(lf)select personid, [2] from #createdpivot#(lf)where [4] is not null and [5] is not null and diff5and4 >3 and diff4and3 >3 and  diff3and2 >3 and diff2and1 >3#(lf)union all#(lf)select personid, [1] from #createdpivot#(lf)where [4] is not null and [5] is not null and diff5and4 >3  and diff4and3 >3 and diff3and2 >3 and diff2and1 >3#(lf)--=========================#(lf)#(lf)union all#(lf)select personid, [5] from #createdpivot#(lf)where [4] is not null and [5] is not null  and diff5and4 >3 and diff4and3 >3 and diff3and2 >3 and diff2and1<=3#(lf)union all#(lf)select personid, [4] from #createdpivot#(lf)where [4] is not null and [5] is not null  and diff5and4 >3 and diff4and3 >3 and diff3and2 >3 and diff2and1<=3#(lf)union all#(lf)select personid, [3] from #createdpivot#(lf)where [4] is not null and [5] is not null and diff5and4 >3 and diff4and3 >3 and diff3and2 >3 and diff2and1<=3#(lf)union all#(lf)select personid, [2] from #createdpivot#(lf)where [4] is not null and [5] is not null  and diff5and4 >3 and diff4and3 >3 and diff3and2 >3 and diff2and1<=3#(lf)--====#(lf)#(lf)#(lf)union all#(lf)select personid, [5] from #createdpivot#(lf)where [4] is not null and [5] is not null  and diff5and4 >3 and diff4and3 >3 and diff3and2 <=3 and diff2and1<=3#(lf)union all#(lf)select personid, [4] from #createdpivot#(lf)where [4] is not null and [5] is not null  and diff5and4 >3 and diff4and3 >3 and diff3and2 <=3 and diff2and1<=3#(lf)union all#(lf)select personid, [3] from #createdpivot#(lf)where [4] is not null and [5] is not null and diff5and4 >3 and diff4and3 >3 and diff3and2 <=3 and diff2and1<=3#(lf)#(lf)--======#(lf)#(lf)union all#(lf)select personid, [5] from #createdpivot#(lf)where [4] is not null and [5] is not null  and diff5and4 >3 and diff4and3 <=3 and diff3and2 <=3 and diff2and1<=3#(lf)union all#(lf)select personid, [4] from #createdpivot#(lf)where [4] is not null and [5] is not null  and diff5and4 >3 and diff4and3 <=3 and diff3and2 <=3 and diff2and1<=3#(lf)--=====#(lf)union all#(lf)select personid, [5] from #createdpivot#(lf)where [5] is not null and [5] is not null  and diff5and4 <=3 and diff4and3 <=3 and diff3and2 <=3 and diff2and1<=3#(lf)#(lf)order by 1,2 desc#(lf)--======#(lf)#(lf)SELECT #(lf)'Seen this Month' as datatype,#(lf)case when  createddate is not null then 1#(lf)else 0#(lf)end as seen_count,#(lf)0 as discharged_count,#(lf)#(lf)#(lf)#accepts2.*,#(lf)case when createddate is null then 'Seen in the last 3 months'#(lf)else 'Accept not Seen'#(lf)end as seenstatus #(lf)into #lastdata#(lf)from #accepts2#(lf)left join #testy2 on #accepts2.personid = #testy2.personid and #accepts2.ReferralStatusStartDate = #testy2.createddate#(lf)#(lf)union all#(lf)#(lf)select#(lf)--top 4 #(lf)'Discharged this month', #(lf)0 as seen_count,#(lf)1 as discharged_count,#(lf)'' as referralno,#(lf)*, #(lf)#(lf)'' as seenstatus from #test#(lf)where ReferralStatusTypeCode = 'Discharged'#(lf)#(lf)union all#(lf)select#(lf)--top 4 #(lf)'Declined this month', #(lf)0 as seen_count,#(lf)1 as discharged_count,#(lf)'' as referralno,#(lf)*, #(lf)#(lf)'' as seenstatus #(lf)#(lf)from #test#(lf) #(lf)where ReferralStatusTypeCode = 'declined'#(lf)--and ReferralStatusStartDate between '2022-04-01' and '2022-04-30'#(lf)#(lf)order by teamname#(lf)#(lf)select#(lf)case when teamname like '%adhb%' then 'Auckland'#(lf)when teamname like '%wdhb%' then 'Waitemata'#(lf)when teamname like 'easeup%west%' then 'Waitemata'#(lf)when teamname like 'easeup%north%' then 'Waitemata'#(lf)when teamname like '%waikato%' then 'Waikato'#(lf)else 'Other Region'#(lf)end as TeamRegion#(lf),#(lf)*,#(lf)cast (referralstatusstartdate as date) as referraldatepure#(lf)into #lastdata2#(lf)from #lastdata#(lf)#(lf)#(lf)--========================#(lf)#(lf)if object_id ('tempdb..#activity') is not null drop table #activity#(lf)#(lf)SELECT  #(lf)case when teamname like '%adhb%' then 'Auckland'#(lf)when teamname like '%wdhb%' then 'Waitemata'#(lf)when teamname like 'easeup%west%' then 'Waitemata'#(lf)when teamname like 'easeup%north%' then 'Waitemata'#(lf)when teamname like '%waikato%' then 'Waikato'#(lf)else 'Other Region'#(lf)end as EaseUpRegion#(lf),FactActivity.ActivityID#(lf),DimPerson.PersonID#(lf),FactActivityParticipant.ReferralID#(lf),DimPerson.PersonReferenceNumber#(lf),DimPerson.PersonFirstName#(lf),DimPerson.PersonLastName#(lf)#(lf),dateadd(day,1,eomonth(activitystartdate,-1)) as activitystartmonth#(lf),FactActivity.ActivityStartDate#(lf),FactActivity.ActivityEndDate#(lf),datediff(minute,FactActivity.ActivityStartDate,FactActivity.ActivityEndDate) as activityduration#(lf),case when datediff(minute,FactActivity.ActivityStartDate,FactActivity.ActivityEndDate) < 10 then 'Under 10 Minutes'#(lf)else '10 Minutes and Over'#(lf)end #(lf)as ActivityMinutes#(lf),FactActivity.ActivitySubject#(lf), DimTeam.TeamID#(lf),DimTeam.TeamName#(lf),DimActivityClassification.ActivityClassificationName#(lf),DimActivityType.ActivityTypeName#(lf),DimActivityType.ActivityTypeDescription#(lf), 1 as activity_count#(lf)into #activity#(lf)#(lf)#(lf)          FROM       dl.FactActivity             #(lf)#(lf)          INNER JOIN dl.FactActivityParticipant   ON FactActivity.ActivityID                   = FactActivityParticipant.ActivityID#(lf)          INNER JOIN dl.DimActivityType           ON FactActivity.ActivityTypeID               = DimActivityType.ActivityTypeID#(lf)          --INNER JOIN dl.FactActivityBreakdown     ON FactActivity.ActivityID                   = FactActivityBreakdown.ActivityID#(lf)         -- INNER JOIN dl.DimActivityBreakdownType  ON FactActivityBreakdown.ActivityBreakdownTypeID    = DimActivityBreakdownType.ActivityBreakdownTypeID#(lf)          INNER JOIN dl.DimActivityClassification ON FactActivity.ActivityClassificationID = DimActivityClassification.ActivityClassificationID#(lf)#(tab)#(tab)  INNER JOIN dl.DimTeam#(tab)#(tab)#(tab)#(tab)#(tab)  ON FactActivity.TeamID = DimTeam.TeamID#(lf)#(tab)#(tab)  INNER JOIN dl.FactReferral#(tab)#(tab)#(tab)  ON FactActivityParticipant.ReferralID = FactReferral.ReferralID#(lf)#(tab)#(tab)  INNER JOIN dl.DimPerson#(tab)#(tab)#(tab)#(tab)  ON FactActivityParticipant.EntityID = DimPerson.PersonID#(lf)#(tab)#(tab)  INNER JOIN dl.DimEthnicity#(tab)#(tab)#(tab)  ON DimPerson.Ethnicity1ID = DimEthnicity.EthnicityID -- taking first Ethnicity#(lf)#(tab)#(tab)  INNER JOIN dl.DimGender#(tab)#(tab)#(tab)      ON DimPerson.GenderID = DimGender.GenderID#(lf)#(tab)#(tab)  left join dl.FactGroupActivity on factactivity.ActivityID = FactGroupActivity.GroupActivityID#(lf)#(tab)#(tab)  #(lf)#(lf)#(tab)#(tab)  WHERE     #(lf)#(tab)#(tab)   Teamname like '%Ease%Up%' -- and ActivitySubject = 'Initial Assessment'#(lf)#(tab)#(tab)   and ReferralCreatedDate >'2019-06-30'#(lf)#(lf)#(tab)#(tab)   ORDER by FactActivityParticipant.ReferralID, ActivityStartDate#(lf)#(lf)#(lf)#(tab)#(tab)   select * from #lastdata2#(lf)#(tab)#(tab)   left join #activity on #lastdata2.referralid = #activity.referralid#(lf)#(tab)#(tab) #(lf)#(tab)#(tab)#(lf)#(tab)#(tab)#(lf)#(lf)#(tab)#(tab)  #(lf)#(tab)#(tab)  "]),
